  },
  "section": "9.7",
  "rulesText": "*This character has three harm: a \"Shattered Right Leg\" (level 3) plus \"Drained\" and \"Battered\" (level 1). If they suffer another level 1 harm, it will move up to level 2. If they suffer another level 3 harm, it will move up to level 4: Fatal.*",
